// logos.std.deem — INCREMENTAL LINEAR-RECURSIVE REL (ADR 0013 slices 5-9 + ADR 0015 S1-S3): IncrRec (semi-naive maintenance, DRed, semilattice aggregation, R4 provenance/explain), trace reification, budgeted fixpoint + truncated_tail, control atoms + journal, Query::incremental_rec.
